OL,3,GNEWSABath Christmas Market's dates,
OL,4,Atravel and quietest times to visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of thousands of people are
OL,7,Fexpected to visit one of the UK's
OL,8,Flargest Christmas market over the
OL,9,Fcoming weeks.
OL,11,FMore than 250 traders are taking part
OL,12,Fin Bath's Christmas market - but with
OL,13,Fthe "huge uplift" in the economy comes
OL,14,Fbusier roads and railway stations.
OL,16,FIf you're planning to visit, find out
OL,17,Fthe best ways to get here, and if you
OL,18,Flive in Bath find out how it might
OL,19,Fimpact you.
OL,21,FThis year's market runs from 26
OL,22,FNovember to 13 December.
